# Sledge-Class Seedship stations with a 6-power Colossal Dreadmaw: six charge counters are not enough (CR 721.2a), so it is still a
# noncreature artifact. Stationing with an Elvish Mystic (power 1) makes seven: a 4/5 artifact creature with flying. It attacks (it
# has been under Bot1's control since T3), and Bot1 puts the Ornithopter from its hand onto the battlefield: a noncreature card in
# hand (Mox Jet) is refused, and the creature card in Bot2's hand stays there.

